<div class="reu-policy__section" id="information-we-collect">
  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We may collect information that you provide directly to us, including your name, email address, billing and shipping details, order information, account details, customer-support messages, newsletter preferences, product reviews and Product Recommendation Quiz responses.</p>
  <p>When you place an order, payment information is processed securely through Shopify and authorised payment providers. REÚ does not receive or store your complete payment-card number.</p>
  <p>We may also collect technical and usage information automatically, including your IP address, browser type, device type, pages viewed, referring pages, approximate location, cookie identifiers and interactions with our website.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="how-we-use-your-information">
  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>We may use information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Process, manage and fulfil orders</li>
    <li>Administer pre-orders</li>
    <li>Send production, shipping and order updates</li>
    <li>Provide customer support</li>
    <li>Prevent fraud and protect the store</li>
    <li>Personalise product discovery</li>
    <li>Generate Product Recommendation Quiz results</li>
    <li>Improve website performance and customer experience</li>
    <li>Maintain business and transaction records</li>
    <li>Comply with legal and regulatory obligations</li>
    <li>Send marketing communications when you have provided the required consent</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="product-recommendation-quiz">
  <h2>3. Product Recommendation Quiz</h2>
  <p>Our Product Recommendation Quiz provides general product guidance based on the goals, flavour preferences, lifestyle and format preferences selected by the customer.</p>
  <p>Quiz results are not medical advice and do not determine whether a supplement is medically suitable for a customer.</p>
  <p>Marketing consent is separate and optional. Customers do not need to subscribe to marketing emails to view their quiz results.</p>
  <p>Sensitive answers relating to pregnancy, medication, medical supervision or allergies must not be used for targeted advertising.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="cookies-and-analytics">
  <h2>4. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
  <p>We may use necessary cookies to operate the website, maintain the shopping cart, remember preferences and support secure checkout.</p>
  <p>With consent where required, we may also use analytics and advertising technologies to understand website activity, measure performance and improve marketing.</p>
  <p>Customers can manage non-essential cookies through the website’s cookie-consent controls and their browser settings.</p>
  <p>Update this section before launch so it accurately names every analytics, advertising, email, live-chat, review and tracking service installed on the store.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="how-we-share-information">
  <h2>5. How We Share Information</h2>
  <p>We may share information with service providers that help us operate the business, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Shopify</li>
    <li>Payment providers</li>
    <li>Production and fulfilment partners</li>
    <li>Shipping carriers</li>
    <li>Customer-support providers</li>
    <li>Email and newsletter platforms</li>
    <li>Review platforms</li>
    <li>Analytics and advertising providers</li>
    <li>Fraud-prevention services</li>
    <li>Professional and legal advisers</li>
    <li>Government authorities where legally required</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These providers should receive only the information reasonably required to perform their services.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="data-retention">
  <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to process orders, provide support, maintain business records, resolve disputes, prevent fraud and comply with legal obligations.</p>
  <p>Retention periods may vary depending on the information and applicable legal requirements.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="data-security">
  <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable administrative, organisational and technical measures to protect personal information. However, no online service or electronic storage method can guarantee absolute security.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="your-privacy-choices">
  <h2>8. Your Privacy Choices</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Request access to personal information</li>
    <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
    <li>Request deletion of certain information</li>
    <li>Restrict or object to certain processing</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent</li>
    <li>Receive a copy of certain information</li>
    <li>Unsubscribe from marketing communications</li>
    <li>Submit a complaint to an appropriate privacy authority</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Marketing emails include an unsubscribe link.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="international-processing">
  <h2>9. International Processing</h2>
  <p>Shopify and other service providers may process information in countries other than the customer’s country of residence. Where required, appropriate safeguards should be used for international transfers.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="childrens-privacy">
  <h2>10. Children’s Privacy</h2>
  <p>The REÚ website and products are not directed toward children. Customers must meet the minimum legal purchase age applicable in their location.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="changes-to-this-policy">
  <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when our services, technology, legal obligations or privacy practices change. The updated policy will display a revised effective date.</p>
</div>

<div class="reu-policy__section" id="contact-us">
  <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>Questions or privacy requests can be submitted through our <a href="{{ pages.contact.url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Contact page</a>.</p>
</div>
